              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY, BIKER, and DREADNOUGHT units that are within 12&quot; of your Warlord at the start of your opponent&apos;s Charge phase can make Heroic Interventions this phase in the same manner as CHARACTERS.</characteristic>
